<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνᾰσ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of athletic exercises, skilled in them,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἢ ἰατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					313d
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				35
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>; <i>of the gymnastic master</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδοτρίβης,</span> q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1288b18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. [θεραπεία]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					464b
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ-κή</span> (with or without
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>),<i>gymnastics,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				187a
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1212
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. λῆμμα</span> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥητορικόν</span>) <i>suited for dialectical
				discussion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				2.76
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>by means of testing,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					139.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
